  "Description": "Streams the current Unreal Editor selection (level actors and Content Browser assets) to a DevGame chat composer over the Editor Presence Protocol (EPP). See docs/workbench/spec-editor-presence.md in the DevGame repo for the protocol and pairing flow. Content-only Python plugin: no compiler, no per-engine-version binary, works on a Blueprint-only project. Editor-only; nothing here ships in a packaged game.",
